log
@WCSLIB 3.6:

   1) Added new service routine wcssub() and removed wcscopy() which is defined
      as a preprocessor macro that invokes it.

   2) Removed vsource from the wcsprm struct and added ssyssrc; modified
      wcsini() and wcsprt() to suit.

   3) In wcsini(), fixed a problem with memory management for wcs.pv when
      NPVMAX is zero likewise for wcs.ps and NPSMAX.

   4) In wcsprt(), don't print auxiliary coordinate system information in
      arrays with zero address.

   5) In wcss2p(), status == 9 (one or more invalid world coordinates) was not
      returned appropriately.

   6) "Error status/code/number" is now referred to consistently as the "status
      return value".

   7) Replaced "error" with "failed" in status messages.

   8) Removed support for K&R C.
